			<attribute key="id" type="int">53</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints to put the logic in words.

1. As there are 1000 pixels in the image, it is difficult for me to remember all the pixels so I will write it down in paper.
2. Now there 10 pixels in icon, that also I have to write in paper.
3. Now I have to keep start comparing each pixel with the first pixel of icon, f they are equal then I will move to next pixel of both image and icon and compare it, I will repeat it till I reach end of the Icon pixels.
4. If all the pixels of icon appeared in the image with the same order, then I will that count.
5. Similarly I will count total how many times that icon appear in the inage.
</attribute>
